---
import Layout from '../layouts/doc.astro';
import { ThemeAppMock } from '../components/theme-app-mock';
import CodeBlock from '../components/code-block.astro';
---

<Layout title="Themes">

<h1>Themes</h1>

<p>Same components, different world. <strong>Pick one in the sidebar.</strong></p>

<div class="theme-showcase">
  <ThemeAppMock client:load />
</div>

<h2>Available themes</h2>

<table>
  <thead>
    <tr><th>Theme</th><th>Light</th><th>Dark</th></tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>Solace</td><td>Warm paper, cool ink — one vivid blue for action</td><td>—</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Porcelain</td><td>Near-white paper, cool graphite ink</td><td>Porcelain inverted</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Tobacco</td><td>Warm earthen paper, quiet signals</td><td>Tobacco inverted</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Marigold</td><td>Pure-grey paper, the loudest signals</td><td>Marigold inverted</td></tr>
    <tr><td>Eucalyptus</td><td>Cool-blue paper, vivid signals</td><td>Eucalyptus inverted</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<p>Every theme supplies 32 palette values and inherits the same 68 semantic names. Import the shared semantic layer plus one palette in your CSS.</p>

<CodeBlock code={`@import "@beaket/ui/themes/semantic.css";
@import "@beaket/ui/themes/solace.css";`} lang="css" />

<h2>Dark mode</h2>

<p>Every theme except Solace ships with a dark twin — Solace is light-only by declaration. Import one palette and dark mode works automatically — no flags, no extra imports, no toggle configuration required.</p>

<h3>How it works</h3>

<p>Each palette file contains both light and dark values. Dark mode activates via <code>@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark)</code>, following the user's OS setting. The semantic layer never changes — shadows and knockouts auto-flip through token references.</p>

<h3>Manual control</h3>

<p>To override OS detection, set <code>beaket-color-scheme</code> in <code>localStorage</code>:</p>

<CodeBlock code={`// Force dark
localStorage.setItem("beaket-color-scheme", "dark");

// Force light
localStorage.setItem("beaket-color-scheme", "light");

// Follow OS (default)
localStorage.removeItem("beaket-color-scheme");`} lang="js" />

</Layout>

<style>
  :global(.main) {
    max-width: none;
  }
  .theme-showcase {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }
</style>
